  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As the REST API gets pulled into trunk, there will no longer need to be a distinction between the REST API and API-A-Lite. This task involves removing the duplicate methods, moving the methods only in API-A-Lite into the REST API, and updating related stylesheets to make everything consistent.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This includes getDissemination and other unimplemented items noted on this page:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/REST+API"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/REST+API",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Goal is to deprecate API-A/M Lite.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
